---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Archivo Figma / Página 2 - Sistema de Diseño (Branding)" embed={true}>
  <div class="editorial-sheet">
    <!-- CABECERA EDITORIAL IDÉNTICA A TU PLANTILLA DE FIGMA -->
    <header class="editorial-header">
      <span class="editorial-kicker">ARCHIVO FIGMA / PÁGINA 2</span>
      <h1>Sistema de Diseño (Branding ISFT N° 191)</h1>
    </header>

    <!-- 1. BRANDING KIT & EMBLEMA OFICIAL -->
    <section class="editorial-section">
      <h2>Identidad Institucional y Emblema Oficial</h2>
      <div class="branding-banner-box">
        <div class="branding-emblem-col">
          <img
            src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nedder3/formularios-web-isft/main/public/logo-isft191.png"
            alt="Escudo Oficial ISFT N° 191"
            width="78"
            height="78"
          />
          <div>
            <strong>ISFT N° 191 - Bahía Blanca</strong>
            <span>Instituto Superior de Formación Técnica N° 191</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="branding-rules-col">
          <p>
            <strong>Concepto Framer Academic Portal:</strong> Alineado cromáticamente con <code>isft191.edu.ar</code>. Utiliza contenedores de doble bisel (<em>Double-Bezel</em>), iconografía vectorial pura (cero emojis), separadores unificados con guion medio (<code> - </code>) y foco exclusivo en la autogestión de mesas examinadoras.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. PALETA DE COLORES (5 TARJETAS VERTICALES COMO EN TU CAPTURA) -->
    <section class="editorial-section">
      <h2>Paleta de Colores</h2>
      <div class="palette-5col">
        <div class="swatch-vertical">
          <div class="swatch-top" style="background: #3438AA;"></div>
          <div class="swatch-body">
            <strong>BRAND PRIMARY</strong>
            <code>#3438AA</code>
            <p>Azul institucional principal (AAA 8.65:1). Usado en cabecera, botones primarios, pasos activos y bordes de foco.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="swatch-vertical">
          <div class="swatch-top" style="background: #252882;"></div>
          <div class="swatch-body">
            <strong>PRIMARY DARK</strong>
            <code>#252882</code>
            <p>Azul profundo (AAA 11.4:1). Estado hover de botones principales, acentos de contraste y textos destacados.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="swatch-vertical">
          <div class="swatch-top" style="background: #C97026;"></div>
          <div class="swatch-body">
            <strong>ACCENT OCHRE</strong>
            <code>#C97026</code>
            <p>Dorado ocre institucional. Línea superior de cabecera, etiquetas de normativa académica y sellos de verificación.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="swatch-vertical">
          <div class="swatch-top" style="background: #1B1F3B;"></div>
          <div class="swatch-body">
            <strong>DEEP NAVY TEXT</strong>
            <code>#1B1F3B</code>
            <p>Texto principal de lectura (AAA 14.8:1). Garantiza máxima legibilidad en etiquetas, selectores y comprobantes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="swatch-vertical">
          <div class="swatch-top" style="background: #EEF2F9; border-bottom: 1px solid #DBE2EF;"></div>
          <div class="swatch-body">
            <strong>FRAMER BEZEL</strong>
            <code>#EEF2F9 / #F6F8FC</code>
            <p>Superficie de fondo general y marco exterior de 6px (Double-Bezel) que enmarca las tarjetas blancas (#FFFFFF).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. TIPOGRAFÍAS (CAJAS EDITORIALES COMO EN TU CAPTURA) -->
    <section class="editorial-section">
      <h2>Tipografías</h2>

      <div class="type-specimen-box">
        <div class="specimen-kicker">TIPOGRAFÍA DE TÍTULOS E INSTITUCIONAL (SANS GEOMÉTRICA DE ALTO IMPACTO)</div>

        <div class="specimen-item">
          <span class="specimen-meta">Plus Jakarta Sans - H1 (ExtraBold 36px / Line-height 1.15)</span>
          <div class="sample-h1">Inscripción a Mesas de Exámenes Finales</div>
        </div>

        <div class="specimen-item">
          <span class="specimen-meta">Plus Jakarta Sans - H2 (Bold 24px / Line-height 1.25)</span>
          <div class="sample-h2">Identificación Personal del Estudiante</div>
        </div>

        <div class="specimen-item">
          <span class="specimen-meta">Plus Jakarta Sans - Subtítulo de Tarjeta (SemiBold 18px)</span>
          <div class="sample-h3">Resumen de Inscripción y Padrón Curricular Oficial</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="type-specimen-box">
        <div class="specimen-kicker">TIPOGRAFÍA DE CUERPO, CONTROLES Y DATOS TABULARES (PRECISIÓN NUMÉRICA)</div>

        <div class="specimen-item">
          <span class="specimen-meta">Inter - Etiquetas y Selectores de Formulario (SemiBold 15px)</span>
          <div class="sample-label">Tecnicatura Superior en Desarrollo de Software (RS 5847/19)</div>
        </div>

        <div class="specimen-item">
          <span class="specimen-meta">Inter - Cuerpo e Instrucciones (Regular 14px)</span>
          <div class="sample-body">
            Registrá una solicitud por cada asignatura a rendir. Tus datos personales quedan recordados localmente para agilizar la carga si te anotás a más de un examen final.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="specimen-item">
          <span class="specimen-meta">JetBrains Mono - DNI, Códigos Curriculares y Comprobante SHA-256 (Bold 15px - tabular-nums)</span>
          <div class="sample-mono">DNI 34945012 - SOFT-203 - ISFT-2026-TEST01 - 27/10/2026 14:47 (GMT-3)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. COMPONENTES DEL SISTEMA (ESTADOS NORMAL / HOVER / ACTIVO + INPUTS) -->
    <section class="editorial-section">
      <h2>Componentes del Sistema</h2>

      <div class="components-showcase-box">
        <div class="specimen-kicker">VARIANTES DE BOTONES INTERACTIVOS Y PÍLDORAS CURRICULARES</div>

        <div class="states-3col">
          <div class="state-card">
            <span class="state-label">01. ESTADO NORMAL</span>
            <div class="btn-sim primary-normal">Confirmar Inscripción a Final</div>
            <div class="btn-sim secondary-normal">Imprimir / Guardar PDF</div>
          </div>

          <div class="state-card">
            <span class="state-label">02. ESTADO HOVER (PASAR MOUSE)</span>
            <div class="btn-sim primary-hover">Confirmar Inscripción a Final</div>
            <div class="btn-sim secondary-hover">Imprimir / Guardar PDF</div>
          </div>

          <div class="state-card">
            <span class="state-label">03. ESTADO SELECCIONADO / ACTIVO</span>
            <div class="pill-sim-active">
              <span>● 2° Año (Segundo)</span>
              <code>8 materias</code>
            </div>
            <div class="input-sim-auto">Docente Algebra y lógica</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="components-showcase-box">
        <div class="specimen-kicker">WIREFRAMES ESTRUCTURALES (GRILLA 65% FORMULARIO / 35% RESUMEN FIJO)</div>

        <div class="states-3col">
          <div class="wf-mini-card">
            <span class="state-label">PASO 1 - IDENTIFICACIÓN</span>
            <div class="wf-mini-split">
              <div class="wf-left">Formulario Personal (65%)<br/>Nombre, DNI, Cohorte, Mail</div>
              <div class="wf-right">Resumen Fijo (35%)</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="wf-mini-card">
            <span class="state-label">PASO 2 - CASCADA DE MATERIA</span>
            <div class="wf-mini-split">
              <div class="wf-left">Carrera - Año - Materia (65%)<br/>Autocompletado Docente</div>
              <div class="wf-right">Resumen Fijo (35%)</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="wf-mini-card">
            <span class="state-label">PASO 3 - COMPROBANTE SHA-256</span>
            <div class="wf-mini-full">
              Ticket Oficial ISFT N° 191 (Imprimible PDF)<br/>+ Impacto en Google Sheet y Mail Quincenal al Docente
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .editorial-sheet {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 3.5rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #1B1F3B;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3.25rem;
  }

  .editorial-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .editorial-kicker {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: #646D8C;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .editorial-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1B1F3B;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .editorial-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.35rem;
  }

  .editorial-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1B1F3B;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
    padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .branding-banner-box {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-left: 4px solid #3438AA;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    background: #F8FAFC;
  }

  .branding-emblem-col {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .branding-emblem-col strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #3438AA;
  }

  .branding-emblem-col span {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #646D8C;
  }

  .branding-rules-col p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #4A516D;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .palette-5col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 1.1rem;
  }

  .swatch-vertical {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .swatch-top {
    height: 115px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .swatch-body {
    padding: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .swatch-body strong {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #1B1F3B;
  }

  .swatch-body code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: #646D8C;
  }

  .swatch-body p {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: #4A516D;
    line-height: 1.45;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .type-specimen-box,
  .components-showcase-box {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.35rem;
  }

  .specimen-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #646D8C;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #F1F5F9;
    padding-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .specimen-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.3rem;
  }

  .specimen-meta {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #646D8C;
  }

  .sample-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1B1F3B;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .sample-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1B1F3B;
  }

  .sample-h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #3438AA;
  }

  .sample-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.96rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #1B1F3B;
  }

  .sample-body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #4A516D;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .sample-mono {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1B1F3B;
  }

  .states-3col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .state-card,
  .wf-mini-card {
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: #F8FAFC;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .state-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #4A516D;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .btn-sim {
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .primary-normal {
    background: #3438AA;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .secondary-normal {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #1B1F3B;
    border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
  }

  .primary-hover {
    background: #252882;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 40, 130, 0.25);
  }

  .secondary-hover {
    background: #EEF0FF;
    color: #3438AA;
    border: 1px solid #3438AA;
  }

  .pill-sim-active {
    background: #EEF0FF;
    border: 1.5px solid #3438AA;
    color: #3438AA;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .input-sim-auto {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1.5px solid #3438AA;
    color: #1B1F3B;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .wf-mini-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.75fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .wf-left,
  .wf-right,
  .wf-mini-full {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px dashed #94A3B8;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: #4A516D;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
